        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions MDS3RDDSBR, Large Pineapple Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe pineapple finials on this pull are indeed large, measuring 4 inches, making them the eye-catcher you need for grand spaces or bigger doors. The Large Pineapple Door Pull is perfect for adding a touch of the ritzy-tropical design iconic of Palm Springs. This handle is available in 19 inch and 24 inch lengths in a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/large-pineapple-back-to-back-door-handle-first-impressions-pr-mds3rddsbr\"><b>Pair Back-to-Back Mounted</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Madison Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pineapple-handle-details.jpg?v=1704354555\"><b>Detailed First Impressions MDS3RDDSBR Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-MDS03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262247\"><b>First Impressions MDS3RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>MDS3019RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>MDS3024RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> <a href=\"/products/large-pineapple-back-to-back-door-handle-first-impressions-pr-mds3rddsbr\"><b>First Impressions Model PR-MDS3RDDSBR</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Pineapple Door Handle",
                "description": "The pineapple finials on this pull are indeed large, measuring 4 inches, making them the eye-catcher you need for grand spaces or bigger doors. The Large Pineapple Door Pull is perfect for adding a touch of the ritzy-tropical design iconic of Palm Springs. This handle is available in 19 inch and 24 inch lengths in a wide array of finishes. \r\n",
